    "description": "Rigid-body hot dogs on a picnic table, built with three.js r169 and cannon-es. Grab and fling them with the mouse, stack them, build and topple a bun pyramid, fire one from the camera with Space, and switch gravity between Moon, Mars, Earth, and Jupiter.",
